Feature: uor_toc_lifecycle

  This repository's Prism application, in app/, generated by prism-code from its
  spec: Give the next lifecycle stage of a UOR Foundation project from its stage now, the application before the TOC, whether a quorum met, the TOC's recorded vote, whether the stage's evidence is complete and how many days the public comment period ran.

  @UT-01 @build
  Scenario: The app never answers graduated when quorum is unmet and stage is incubation
    Given the model in app/src/UorTocLifecycle.lex.tex
    When the Lean kernel checks inv001Holds during prismpm verify
    Then no request meets breaksInv001

